,"original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"昧","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"祖昧只原文明名，與先秦昧、公孫昧及昧蔡不同語境，不同名合。","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001","chapter_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-song064-mei","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi","surfaces":["昧"],"scope":"same_chapter","status":"contextual_provisional","confidence_level":"medium","identification_basis":{"kind":"source_context","target_mention_ids":["c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0016"]},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-064","chapter_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi","source_id":"s-song064-ws1748217","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001","quote":"裴松之，字世期，河東聞喜人也。祖昧，光祿大夫。父珪，正員外郎。松之年八歳，學通論語、毛詩。博覽墳籍，立身簡素。年二十，拜殿中將軍。此官直衞左右，晉孝武太元中革選名家以參顧問，始用琅邪王茂之、會稽謝輶，皆南北之望。舅庾楷在江陵，欲得松之西上，除新野太守，以事難不行。拜員外散騎侍郎。義熙初，爲吳興故鄣令，在縣有績。入爲尚書祠部郎。"}],"rationale":"祖昧只原文明名，與先秦昧、公孫昧及昧蔡不同語境，不同名合。","human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"text":"裴松之，字世期，河東聞喜人也。祖昧，光祿大夫。父珪，正員外郎。松之年八歳，學通論語、毛詩。博覽墳籍，立身簡素。年二十，拜殿中將軍。此官直衞左右，晉孝武太元中革選名家以參顧問，始用琅邪王茂之、會稽謝輶，皆南北之望。舅庾楷在江陵，欲得松之西上，除新野太守，以事難不行。拜員外散騎侍郎。義熙初，爲吳興故鄣令，在縣有績。入爲尚書祠部郎。","source_position":{"start":8165,"end":8685,"raw":"　　{{ProperNoun|裴-{松}-之}}，字{{ProperNoun|世期}}，{{ProperNoun|河東}}{{ProperNoun|聞喜}}人也。祖{{ProperNoun|昧}}，光祿大夫。父{{ProperNoun|珪}}，正員外郎。{{ProperNoun|-{松}-之}}年八歳，學通{{WavyBookMark|[[論語]]}}、{{WavyBookMark|[[毛詩]]}}。博覽墳籍，立身簡素。年二十，拜殿中將軍。此官直衞左右，{{ProperNoun|晉孝武}}{{ProperNoun|太元}}中革選名家以參顧問，始用{{ProperNoun|琅邪}}{{ProperNoun|王茂之}}、{{ProperNoun|會稽}}{{ProperNoun|謝輶}}，皆南北之望。舅{{ProperNoun|庾楷}}在{{ProperNoun|江陵}}，欲得{{ProperNoun|-{松}-之}}西上，除{{ProperNoun|新野}}太守，以事難不行。拜員外散騎侍郎。{{ProperNoun|義熙}}初，爲{{ProperNoun|吳興}}{{ProperNoun|故鄣}}令，在縣有績。入爲尚書祠部郎。","raw_path":"sources/songshu/wikisource-1748217-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"裴松之","kind":"person","person_id":"301_026_427","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"世期","kind":"person","person_id":"301_026_427","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"昧","kind":"person","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"祖昧只原文明名，與先秦昧、公孫昧及昧蔡不同語境，不同名合。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"珪","kind":"person","person_id":"ho3_f0x_fyh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"父珪正員外郎；與孔珪/蔡敏兄珪/檀珪等不同姓世系，不合。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"301_026_427","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0072","start":72,"end":75,"surface":"晉孝武","kind":"person","person_id":"uke_dff_yrf","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"明晉孝武太元；排除宋孝武與漢武。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"王茂之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDABA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"太元選殿中將軍之琅邪王茂之；既有晉076胡之子茂之、宋066敬弘父茂之為晉世名家，來源限定暫定同人，未據此補新官年。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"謝輶","kind":"person","person_id":"ao0_c0z_ryc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"會稽謝輶與既有宋092內史謝輶之同時地望職事相合，暫定同人。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"庾楷","kind":"person","person_id":"4qr_wrk_3vd_BBB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"舅庾楷在江陵與既有晉073/099庾楷晉末江陵事件脈絡相符；舅關係本批只proposal，不擴世系。"},{"id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi:p001:m0115","start":115,"end":117,"surface":"松之","kind":"person","person_id":"301_026_427","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本傳裴松之字世期、注陳壽三國志及子駰；既有宋053中書侍郎裴松之與梁030曾祖松之太中大夫脈絡相符，重用同人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-064","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-song064-ws1748217"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-064-peisongzhi","work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-064","source_id":"s-song064-ws1748217","source":{"title":"宋書/卷64","revision_id":1748217,"revision_timestamp":"2019-10-16T05:46:10Z","status":200,"response_sha256":"010f6b9a277c33ab190dfbea81673926e2b637f8765888cda9d19361df936141","raw_sha256":"aeb7f890fb1a261a285786bd19844cbc090dc96e35d7ca61cf8ca1eadf66afb8","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B764&oldid=1748217","api_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/api.php?action=query&format=json&formatversion=2&prop=revisions&rvprop=ids%7Ctimestamp%7Ccontent&rvslots=main&titles=%E5%AE%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B764","image_verified":false,"human_reviewed":false,"provider":"Wikisource","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%AE%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B764&oldid=1748217","raw_path":"sources/songshu/wikisource-1748217-raw.wikitext","raw_file_sha256":"aeb7f890fb1a261a285786bd19844cbc090dc96e35d7ca61cf8ca1eadf66afb8","edition":null,"accessed_on":"2026-10-20","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","extent":"卷六十四裴松之完整傳6段1631字；不是全卷，維基數位校注分層保留為參照。","normalization":{"description":"保原字，wiki wrapper/本傳10則數位ref移除以逐碼projection及digital-notes-layer.json記錄；omitted_digital_paratext專供節題非ref，本單